gsnprov:dd-0122
    a gsnprov:RetiredDecision ;
    gsnprov:retirementReason "enumeration extended with “dialectic” in 1.2.3. It was written from Core GSN and never extended when the Dialectic Extension added the challenges relationship, so a reified challenge had no legal value and rule S50 was left creating untyped relationships, alone among the four relation-creating rules. Superseded by the extended enumeration recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsnprov:positionKey "S03.R041" ;
    gsnprov:part gsnprov:part-0 ;
    gsnprov:section gsnprov:sec-part0-glossary ;
    gsnprov:formalism gsnprov:OWL ;
    gsnprov:naturalLanguage "A relationship type is recorded as one of contextual, evidential or inferential."@en ;
    gsnprov:nlWrittenFor "21b29182" ;
    prov:used gsnprov:src-0034 ;
    prov:generated gsnprov:st-0122 .

