gsnprov:dd-0266
    a gsnprov:RetiredDecision ;
    gsnprov:retirementReason "domain extended with gsn:AssuranceCase in 1.2.3. The domain covered arguments and elements but not the case containing them, so a case could not state the claim it exists to establish. gsn:inDoubt already admitted the class for the same kind of property, so the omission was an oversight rather than a decision. Superseded by the extended domain recorded in the same release."@en ;
