gsnprov:dd-0296
    a gsnprov:RetiredDecision ;
    gsnprov:retirementReason "the object restriction was extended with gsn:Relationship in 1.2.3. gsn:challenges is defined as allowing a challenge to any GSN entity and its range had already been widened in the shapes to admit a relationship; the reified form had not been widened to match, so rule S51 produced a relationship the restriction rejected. Superseded by the extended restriction recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsnprov:positionKey "S04.R127" ;
    gsnprov:part gsnprov:part-1 ;
    gsnprov:section gsnprov:sec-core ;
    gsnprov:formalism gsnprov:OWL ;
