gsnprov:dd-0465
    a gsnprov:RetiredDecision ;
    gsnprov:retirementReason "range widened to admit GSN elements in 1.2.3. The range named only gsn:Template, which reads the class definition as though the reference attached to the template as a whole; the definition says the GSN argument below the attached element. Widened to a union rather than replaced, because gsn:Template is a gsn:Pattern and gsn:Pattern falls outside gsn:GSNElement, so a bare replacement would have made whole-template attachments illegal. Superseded by the widened range recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsnprov:positionKey "S05.R148" ;
    gsnprov:part gsnprov:part-1 ;
    gsnprov:section gsnprov:sec-pattern ;
    gsnprov:formalism gsnprov:OWL ;
    gsnprov:naturalLanguage "Something can only be attached to a template."@en ;
    gsnprov:nlWrittenFor "35ea9130" ;
    prov:used gsnprov:src-0138 ;
    prov:generated gsnprov:st-0465 .

