gsnprov:dd-0475
    a gsnprov:RetiredDecision ;
    gsnprov:retirementReason "domain extended with gsn:Pattern in 1.2.3. A pattern is an argument structure and holds the elements it is built from, and rule S22 matches containment by a template. gsn:Catalogue remains outside the declared domain and continues to be admitted by the shape alone, under its own decision. Superseded by the extended domain recorded in the same release."@en ;
    gsnprov:positionKey "S06.R007" ;
    gsnprov:part gsnprov:part-1 ;
    gsnprov:section gsnprov:sec-modular ;
    gsnprov:formalism gsnprov:OWL ;
